## 3. Route Guard & RBAC Architecture

The Edge middleware in [src/middleware.ts](file:///C:/Users/Fadil/.gemini/antigravity-ide/scratch/custom-lms/src/middleware.ts) and [src/lib/supabase/middleware.ts](file:///C:/Users/Fadil/.gemini/antigravity-ide/scratch/custom-lms/src/lib/supabase/middleware.ts) refreshes Supabase cookies and protects dashboard routes:
- Unauthenticated requests to `/student`, `/teacher`, or `/admin` are intercepted and redirected with HTTP 307 to `/login?redirectTo=<targetPath>`.
- Authenticated requests to `/login` or `/register` are automatically forwarded into the portal.

